1
00:00:09,648 --> 00:00:11,550
AFTER THE DEATH OF A FRIEND
FROM HOME...

2
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:12,417
DAMN IT!

3
00:00:12,417 --> 00:00:13,852
KAHLEN HAD
TO FACE HER GRIEF

4
00:00:13,852 --> 00:00:15,420
AT A GRAVEYARD PHOTO SHOOT.

5
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:16,555
DO YOU GUYS KNOW
WHAT'S WRONG WITH KAHLEN?

6
00:00:16,555 --> 00:00:18,056
SHE HAD A FRIEND
THAT JUST DIED.

7
00:00:18,056 --> 00:00:20,058
OH, MY GOSH.

8
00:00:20,058 --> 00:00:22,861
BUT SHE CHANNELED HER EMOTIONS
INTO A FIERCE PERFORMANCE.

9
00:00:22,861 --> 00:00:24,362
(screaming)

10
00:00:24,362 --> 00:00:25,430
GOT IT, GOOD.

11
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:28,200
CHRISTINA STRUGGLED
TO HEAT UP A LUSTY SHOT,

12
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:31,103
BUT IN THE END IT WAS TATIANA
WHO DIDN'T DELIVER.

13
00:00:31,103 --> 00:00:33,171
THIS WEEK
I THINK SHE JUST FELL APART.

14
00:00:33,171 --> 00:00:34,806
AND SHE WAS SENT HOME.

15
00:00:34,806 --> 00:00:36,541
ONLY SIX GIRLS REMAIN.

16
00:00:36,541 --> 00:00:38,710
WHO WILL BE ELIMINATED TONIGHT?

17
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:46,618
♪♪♪

18
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:25,056
♪♪♪

19
00:01:25,056 --> 00:01:26,458
IT GETS MORE
AND MORE NERVE-RACKING

20
00:01:26,458 --> 00:01:27,592
EVERY SINGLE ELIMINATION.

21
00:01:27,592 --> 00:01:28,360
MM-HMM.

22
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:29,528
WHEN THEY SAID TO PICK
ONE OF 'EM

23
00:01:29,528 --> 00:01:30,729
WHO WANTS THIS
MORE THAN THE OTHER...

24
00:01:30,729 --> 00:01:32,097
I THOUGHT IT WAS MICHELLE.

25
00:01:32,097 --> 00:01:33,265
YOU THOUGHT SHE WAS GOING?

26
00:01:33,265 --> 00:01:35,367
NO, I THOUGHT MICHELLE WAS
GONNA BE THE ONE TO STAY.

27
00:01:35,367 --> 00:01:37,502
MICHELLE DOES WANT IT
MORE THAN TATIANA.

28
00:01:37,502 --> 00:01:38,537
CRAZINESS, BRITTANY.

29
00:01:38,537 --> 00:01:40,338
BEING IN THE FINAL TWO,
I WAS LIKE, "OH, MY GOD!"

30
00:01:40,338 --> 00:01:41,873
I KNOW.

31
00:01:41,873 --> 00:01:44,442
BUT I REALLY, REALLY
DID THINK I WAS GOING HOME.

32
00:01:44,442 --> 00:01:46,578
BECAUSE I WAS ONE
OF THE LAST TWO

33
00:01:46,578 --> 00:01:48,146
STANDING UP THERE
TO GET MY PICTURE,

34
00:01:48,146 --> 00:01:51,283
I HAVE TO STEP MY COMPETITION
UP IN EVERY ASPECT,

35
00:01:51,283 --> 00:01:53,018
NOT ONLY
IN THE PHOTO SHOOTS

36
00:01:53,018 --> 00:01:55,687
BUT IN EVERY SINGLE CHALLENGE
THEY GIVE US, TOO.

37
00:01:55,687 --> 00:01:57,189
I'VE CHANGED SO MUCH.

38
00:01:57,189 --> 00:01:58,890
NO, I TOLD SOMEBODY THAT
THE OTHER DAY.

39
00:01:58,890 --> 00:02:00,225
LIKE, LOOKING AT
THIS PICTURE,

40
00:02:00,225 --> 00:02:01,927
I DON'T LOOK AT THAT
AND SEE YOU ANYMORE.

41
00:02:01,927 --> 00:02:03,195
OH, LOOK AT THIS GOOBER.

42
00:02:04,229 --> 00:02:07,299
TYRA MAIL! AAH!

43
00:02:07,299 --> 00:02:08,266
WHO WANTS TO READ IT?

44
00:02:08,266 --> 00:02:09,701
