45
00:02:09,701 --> 00:02:10,368
YEAH!

46
00:02:10,368 --> 00:02:14,505
"ARE YOU BORN TO BE WILD?
BE READY AT 8:30 A.M."

47
00:02:14,505 --> 00:02:16,575
