THAT SUPPOSED TO MEAN?

48
00:02:16,575 --> 00:02:17,776
"TO BE WILD."

49
00:02:17,776 --> 00:02:18,777
IT'S ANIMALS.

50
00:02:18,777 --> 00:02:20,478
MUSIC VIDEO!

51
00:02:20,478 --> 00:02:22,180
THERE ARE SIX GIRLS LEFT
IN THE COMPETITION,

52
00:02:22,180 --> 00:02:24,015
AND WE ALL
GOT TO STEP IT UP.

53
00:02:24,015 --> 00:02:25,283
I LOVE YOU, GIRLS!

54
00:02:25,283 --> 00:02:26,084
I DON'T CARE HOW MUCH

55
00:02:26,084 --> 00:02:27,319
THE OTHER GIRLS
SAY THEY WANT IT,

56
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:28,420
I WANT IT
MORE THAN ALL OF 'EM.

57
00:02:28,420 --> 00:02:30,956
BORN TO BE NAKED, YEAH!

58
00:02:30,956 --> 00:02:32,724
YOU KNOW BRITTANY WAS BORN
TO BE WILD.

59
00:02:32,724 --> 00:02:35,160
THIS IS HOW I DANCE
WHEN I GO OUT.

60
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:39,731
♪♪♪

61
00:02:39,731 --> 00:02:40,498
LET'S GO, KIDS.

62
00:02:40,498 --> 00:02:41,733
WE'RE LEAVING.

63
00:02:46,004 --> 00:02:47,606
LIKE 16.

64
00:02:47,606 --> 00:02:49,908
CARBS ARE MY ENEMY
AND MY FRIEND.

65
00:02:49,908 --> 00:02:51,877
LIKE, I LOVE BREAD,

66
00:02:51,877 --> 00:02:53,511
BUT I GOTTA WATCH
HOW MUCH I EAT,

67
00:02:53,511 --> 00:02:54,412
BECAUSE I'M A MODEL.

68
00:02:54,412 --> 00:02:56,114
I REALLY HAVE TO
FOCUS ON THIS.

69
00:02:56,114 --> 00:02:59,017
KEENYAH, SHE HAS GAINED
ABOUT 10 POUNDS.

70
00:02:59,017 --> 00:03:02,487
THE GIRL CAN SNACK
LIKE NO OTHER.

71
00:03:02,487 --> 00:03:09,628
♪♪♪

72
00:03:09,628 --> 00:03:10,695
