74
00:03:12,564 --> 00:03:15,367
IT'S RAINING,
AND THERE IS J. ALEXANDER

75
00:03:15,367 --> 00:03:18,470
WAITING FOR US
WITH AN UMBRELLA.

76
00:03:18,470 --> 00:03:20,105
GOOD MORNING,
AND CONGRATULATIONS

77
00:03:20,105 --> 00:03:21,973
TO THE FINAL
SIX LUCKY BITCHES.

78
00:03:21,973 --> 00:03:22,707
(laughs)

79
00:03:22,707 --> 00:03:24,976
TODAY WE HAVE
SOME ANIMALS, ACTUALLY.

80
00:03:24,976 --> 00:03:26,511
YOU'RE GONNA BE STUDYING
THE ANIMAL

81
00:03:26,511 --> 00:03:28,246
AND LEARNING
FROM THE ANIMAL HOW TO POSE,

82
00:03:28,246 --> 00:03:30,582
AND THIS IS ACTUALLY GONNA BE
PART OF YOUR CHALLENGE,

83
00:03:30,582 --> 00:03:32,884
POSING LIKE THE ANIMALS
THAT YOU'VE SEEN.

84
00:03:32,884 --> 00:03:35,186
WE HAVE LIONS AND TIGERS
AND BEARS.

85
00:03:35,186 --> 00:03:37,055
OH, MY!

86
00:03:37,055 --> 00:03:39,024
I HAVE ERIC AND JET.

87
00:03:39,024 --> 00:03:39,658
HI.

88
00:03:39,658 --> 00:03:42,027
AND THEY WILL EXPLAIN
THE SAFETY OF THESE ANIMALS.

89
00:03:42,027 --> 00:03:44,496
I'M A LITTLE NERVOUS 'CAUSE
THESE ARE WILD ANIMALS.

90
00:03:44,496 --> 00:03:46,064
IF AN ANIMAL COMES AT ME,

91
00:03:46,064 --> 00:03:47,933
THANK GOD I CAN RUN,
AND I AM FAST,

92
00:03:47,933 --> 00:03:49,434
BECAUSE THAT'S WHAT
I'M GONNA DO.

93
00:03:49,434 --> 00:03:52,437
IF THE ANIMAL GETS AWAY
FROM US, DO NOT MOVE.

94
00:03:52,437 --> 00:03:54,205
THIS ANIMAL
WILL RUN AFTER YOU.

95
00:03:54,205 --> 00:03:55,740
ALL RIGHT.

96
00:03:55,740 --> 00:03:57,676
GREAT,
THERE GOES MY GAME PLAN.

97
00:03:57,676 --> 00:04:01,379
HERE WE HAVE ATHARI,
THE WONDERFUL LEOPARD.

98
00:04:01,379 --> 00:04:02,480
LOOK AT THE PAWS.

99
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,448
YOU SEE THE ANGLES
OF THE BODY?

100
00:04:03,448 --> 00:04:04,316
