101
00:04:04,316 --> 00:04:05,150
WHEN I TELL YOU YOU GIRLS,

102
00:04:05,150 --> 00:04:06,985
"STRETCH FROM THE WAIST UP,
BABY," THERE YOU HAVE IT.

103
00:04:06,985 --> 00:04:07,719
(snarls)

104
00:04:07,719 --> 00:04:08,153
AAH!

105
00:04:08,153 --> 00:04:09,721
OOH.

106
00:04:09,721 --> 00:04:11,623
AND GIRLS, THIS IS KISMET.

107
00:04:11,623 --> 00:04:15,293
KIZZY IS HOLDING HER POSES
FOR 30 SECONDS OR MORE.

108
00:04:15,293 --> 00:04:17,762
