OH, MY.

118
00:04:36,548 --> 00:04:37,716
(roars)

119
00:04:37,716 --> 00:04:40,218
KIND OF LOOKS LIKE
MY LAST BOYFRIEND.

120
00:04:40,218 --> 00:04:41,786
THIS IS BAMBAM.

121
