CATCH, CATCH, CATCH.

126
00:04:49,361 --> 00:04:50,128
EXTENSION.

127
00:04:50,128 --> 00:04:51,896
I'M REALLY TRYING
TO STUDY THE BEAR

128
00:04:51,896 --> 00:04:54,265
AND SEE
HOW I CAN IMITATE A BEAR.

129
00:04:54,265 --> 00:04:56,267
IT'S REALLY HARD
TO IMITATE A BEAR.

130
00:04:56,267 --> 00:04:57,435
