FOR THE BEAR SO MUCH.

132
00:05:01,773 --> 00:05:03,208
IT'S GOT A LOT OF SLOBBER,

133
00:05:03,208 --> 00:05:04,476
AND I JUST KIND OF KEEP
STARING AT THE SLOBBER,

134
00:05:04,476 --> 00:05:06,511
