141
00:05:15,820 --> 00:05:16,521
ALL RIGHT.

142
00:05:16,521 --> 00:05:17,622
COME HERE, BABY.

143
00:05:21,459 --> 00:05:22,761
OOH, LOVIN' IT!

144
00:05:22,761 --> 00:05:23,561
EW!

145
00:05:23,561 --> 00:05:25,330
EXCELLENT.

146
00:05:25,330 --> 00:05:27,065
