151
00:05:33,271 --> 00:05:34,606
AND ALL
THIS OTHER KIND OF STUFF,

152
00:05:34,606 --> 00:05:37,208
BUT KISSING THAT SLOBBER,
I'M SORRY, EW!

153
00:05:37,208 --> 00:05:38,510
THE BAR HAS BEEN RAISED.

154
00:05:38,510 --> 00:05:39,544
COME ON, KAHLEN,
YOU CAN DO IT.

155
00:05:39,544 --> 00:05:40,378
KAHLEN, GET RIGHT IN THERE.

156
00:05:40,378 --> 00:05:41,513
FURTHER,
CLOSER, CLOSER, CLOSER.

157
00:05:41,513 --> 00:05:42,147
LET HIM TAKE IT.

158
00:05:42,147 --> 00:05:43,415
THERE YOU GO!

159
00:05:43,415 --> 00:05:44,115
THAT'S JUST SICK.

160
00:05:44,115 --> 00:05:45,683
I WANT TO GO HOME
AND BRUSH MY TEETH

161
00:05:45,683 --> 00:05:47,385
