163
00:05:49,888 --> 00:05:50,555
EW.

164
00:05:50,555 --> 00:05:52,757
OKAY, GIRLS, GIVE ME A POSE

165
00:05:52,757 --> 00:05:56,061
THAT YOU REMEMBERED FROM
ATHARI THE LEOPARD.

166
00:05:58,229 --> 00:05:59,998
WHY IS EVERYONE
GETTING DOWN ON THE GROUND?

167
00:05:59,998 --> 00:06:01,866
MOST OF THE ANIMALS
THAT WE'VE SEEN TODAY

168
00:06:01,866 --> 00:06:03,568
