174
00:06:16,414 --> 00:06:17,816
KISMET, THE TIGER

175
00:06:17,816 --> 00:06:20,952
WHO ALMOST TOOK A LITTLE
SWIPE AT ME, I THINK.

176
00:06:20,952 --> 00:06:23,855
MAYBE IT WAS MY SCENT,
ALL EAU DE NEGRESSE.

177
00:06:23,855 --> 00:06:29,394
♪♪♪

178
00:06:29,394 --> 00:06:31,529
