LIKE, "RAWR!"

188
00:06:59,757 --> 00:07:02,127
OK, GIRLS, UP, UP.

189
00:07:02,127 --> 00:07:03,428
THANK YOU. RELAX.

190
00:07:03,428 --> 00:07:07,332
THE GIRL WHO I THINK DESERVED
TO WIN THIS COMPETITION,

191
00:07:07,332 --> 00:07:10,735
BECAUSE SHE DID A LOT MORE
WITH HER FACE, WAS BRITTANY.

192
00:07:10,735 --> 00:07:11,903
(snarls)

193
00:07:11,903 --> 00:07:13,004
(laughs)

194
00:07:13,004 --> 00:07:15,440
IF I END UP GOING HOME,
AT LEAST I'VE WON A CHALLENGE.

195
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:17,075
IT'S NOT LIKE,
"SHE'S JUST A LOSER.

196
00:07:17,075 --> 00:07:18,610
SHE DIDN'T WIN ANYTHING."

197
00:07:18,610 --> 00:07:19,110
YAY!

198
00:07:19,110 --> 00:07:21,613
SO YOU GET
TO PICK TWO FRIENDS.

199
00:07:21,613 --> 00:07:23,581
I PICK KEENYAH AND CHRISTINA.

200
00:07:23,581 --> 00:07:26,251
I HAVE NO IDEA
WHAT THE REWARD IS YET.

201
00:07:26,251 --> 00:07:29,420
I JUST KNOW I GET TO
BRING ALONG TWO FRIENDS.

202
00:07:29,420 --> 00:07:30,522
ACTUALLY, THERE'S IS
ONE MORE ANIMAL

203
00:07:30,522 --> 00:07:31,623
