204
00:07:31,623 --> 00:07:33,992
THAT'S THE FIERCEST ANIMAL
OF ALL.

205
00:07:36,995 --> 00:07:38,530
HELLO!

206
00:07:38,530 --> 00:07:39,631
HOW ARE YOU?

207
00:07:39,631 --> 00:07:40,732
HI!

208
00:07:40,732 --> 00:07:41,933
