1177
00:41:49,779 --> 00:41:51,414
I DO THINK
IT MAKES HER LOOK THICKER.

1178
00:41:51,414 --> 00:41:54,116
IT LOOKS LIKE SHE'S SMELLING
SOMETHING ROTTEN.

1179
00:41:54,116 --> 00:41:56,953
